### Page 28 of 44

```text
Runway Design Standards
+ Evaluated Runway 09-27 and 13-31 to determine compliance with FAA
AC 150/5300-13B, Change 1 Airport Design
+ Determined the following design components do not meet FAA
standards
▪ROFA & RSA length beyond departure end – extends into Central Ave
▪Runway Protection Zone – In compatible development such as roads on
both ends
▪Holding Position for Runway 09-27 – 12 feet to close to the runway
environment
+ These nonstandard conditions will be evaluated in the alternatives
development process
```

