```text
Terminal Requirements Methodology
+ Industry guidance utilized:
▪Airport Cooperative Research Program
(ACRP), Report 25, Airport Passenger
Terminal Planning and Design
▪ International Air Transport Association (IATA)
Airport Development Reference Manual
(ADRM), 12th Edition
+ Space standards and wait times are
measured against IATA’s Level of Service
(LoS) standards
+ “Optimum” LoS corresponds to stable flows,
acceptable delays, and a good level of
passenger comfort
+ Peak hour forecast provides demand basis
for requirements to ensure facilities are sized
to meet a sufficiently busy demand period
Source: Adapted from Airport Terminal Reference Manual (ADRM), 12th Edition, International Air Transport Association, 2022
